# Image Placeholders Directory

Add your images here to replace the placeholders throughout the site.

## Required Images:

### hero-product-demo.gif (or .mp4/.webm)
- Location: Hero section
- Size: 1280x720 recommended
- Content: Product demo showing chat interface, streaming, provider switching

### about-team-photo.jpg (or .png)
- Location: About section
- Size: 800x600 recommended
- Content: Founder photo, team photo, or workspace image

## How to Replace:

1. Add your image to this directory with the matching filename
2. Open the component file and replace the <ImagePlaceholder> or <GifPlaceholder>
   with a standard next/image component:

```tsx
import Image from "next/image"

<Image
  src="/images/hero-product-demo.gif"
  alt="Clarity Chat Demo"
  fill
  className="object-cover"
/>
```
